ent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 dark:from-white dark:via-gray-100 dark:to-white drop-shadow-sm" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;">SHERLOCK</span><span class="block text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-purple-600 dark:from-blue-400 dark:via-indigo-400 dark:to-purple-400 animate-gradient bg-300% drop-shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.5)] dark:drop-shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(96,165,250,0.6)]" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;">OSINT</span></h1></div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3 sm:mb-4" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;">Username Search</h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-prose leading-relaxed" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;">Search across <span class="font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">700+ platforms</span> to check public profile links. Enter a username below to review where it appears online.</p><div class="mt-5 sm:mt-6 md:mt-8"><div class="flex space-x-1 my-6 mb-2"><div class="overflow-hidden pb-2" style="width: fit-content;"><div class="text-xs sm:text-base md:text-xl lg:text-3xl xl:text-5xl font-bold" style="white-space: nowrap;"><div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">E</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">x</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">p</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">l</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">o</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">r</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">e</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">p</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">u</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">b</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">l</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">i</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">c</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><s