xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 truncate">tiktok.com</div></div></div><button class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 sm:px-3 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded-md bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white flex-shrink-0 ml-2">View</button></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 md:mt-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10 md:mb-12"><div class="flex justify-center mb-3 sm:mb-4"><div class="flex space-x-1 my-6"><div class="overflow-hidden pb-2" style="width: fit-content;"><div class="text-xs sm:text-base md:text-xl lg:text-3xl xl:text-5xl font-bold" style="white-space: nowrap;"><div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">W</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">h</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">a</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">t</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">C</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">a</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">n</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">Y</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">o</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">u</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">R</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">e</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">v</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">i</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">e</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">w</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">?</span>&nbsp;</div></div> </div> </div><span class="block rounded-sm w-[4px] h-4 sm:h-6 xl:h-12 bg-blue-500" style="opacity: 0;"></span></div></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">Username lookup helps you review publicly available signals associated with a username across multiple sources when available. Results vary based on the username and source availability; not all information may be accessible for every search.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5 md:gap-6"><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe h-6 w-6 sm:h-7 sm:w-7 md:h-8 md:w-8 text-blue-500 mb-3 sm:mb-4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Social Media Profiles</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Browse publicly available profile links across popular platforms.</p></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user h-6 w-6 sm:h-7 sm:w-7 md:h-8 md:w-8 text-blue-500 mb-3 sm:mb-4"><path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Profile Links</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Review available profile and account signals where visible.</p></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6 sm:h-7 sm:w-7 md:h-8 md:w-8 text-blue-500 mb-3 sm:mb-4"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Connected Accounts</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Review accounts that may share the same username.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 md:mt-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10 md:mb-12"><div class="flex justify-center mb-3 sm:mb-4"><div class="flex space-x-1 my-6"><div class="overflow-hidden pb-2" style="width: 0%;"><div class="text-xs sm:text-base md:text-xl lg:text-3xl xl:text-5xl font-bold" style="white-space: nowrap;"><div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">H</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">o</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">w</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">t</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">o</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">U</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">s</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">e</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">S</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">h</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">e</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">r</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">l</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">o</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">c</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">k</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">O</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">S</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">I</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">N</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">T</span>&nbsp;</div></div> </div> </div><span class="block rounded-sm w-[4px] h-4 sm:h-6 xl:h-12 bg-blue-500" style="opacity: 0;"></span></div></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">Using Sherlock OSINT is quite simple and can be completed in just a few steps:</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5 md:gap-6"><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl mb-3 sm:mb-4">1</div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Username Input</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Enter your username in the search box. Avoid using special characters and prefer combinations of letters and numbers only for best results.</p></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl mb-3 sm:mb-4">2</div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Start Search</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Click the search button or press Enter. The system will automatically check across 400+ platforms for potential matches.</p></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl mb-3 sm:mb-4">3</div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Review Results</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">When the search is completed, a list of possible profiles will be displayed in a table with direct links. Each result shows platform information and status.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 md:mt-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10 md:mb-12"><div class="flex justify-center mb-3 sm:mb-4"><div class="flex space-x-1 my-6"><div class="overflow-hidden pb-2" style="width: 0%;"><div class="text-xs sm:text-base md:text-xl lg:text-3xl xl:text-5xl font-bold" style="white-space: nowrap;"><div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">T</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">i</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">p</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">s</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">a</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">n</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">d</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">E</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">t</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">h</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">i</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">c</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">a</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">l</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">U</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">s</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">a</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">g</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">e</span>&nbsp;</div></div> </div> </div><span class="block rounded-sm w-[4px] h-4 sm:h-6 xl:h-12 bg-blue-500" style="opacity: 0;"></span></div></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">When using OSINT tools, it is extremely important to comply with ethical rules and stay within legal boundaries. Here are important tips for using Sherlock OSINT responsibly:</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5 md:gap-6"><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Legal Framework</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Only investigate publicly available information. Respect the privacy of personal data and act in accordance with data protection laws such as GDPR and local privacy regulations. Limit your investigations to educational purposes, security analysis, or legal investigations.</p></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Ethical Boundaries</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Do not use the information you obtain for harassment, bullying, or malicious purposes. Protect individuals' privacy rights and be careful when sharing information. Always consider the potential impact of your investigations on the subjects.</p></div><div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Verification</h3><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Always cross-verify OSINT results. Do not rely entirely on information from a single source and confirm with different sources whenever possible. False positives can occur, so thorough verification is essential.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 md:mt-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-10 sm:pb-12 md:pb-16"><div class="text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10 md:mb-12"><div class="flex justify-center mb-3 sm:mb-4"><div class="flex space-x-1 my-6"><div class="overflow-hidden pb-2" style="width: 0%;"><div class="text-xs sm:text-base md:text-xl lg:text-3xl xl:text-5xl font-bold" style="white-space: nowrap;"><div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">F</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">r</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">e</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">q</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">u</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">e</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">n</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">t</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">l</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">y</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="dark:text-white text-black">A</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">s</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">k</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">e</span><span class="dark:text-white text-black">d</span>&nbsp;</div><div class="inline-block"><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">Q</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">u</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">e</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">s</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">t</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">i</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">o</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">n</span><span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">s</span>&nbsp;</div></div> </div> </div><span class="block rounded-sm w-[4px] h-4 sm:h-6 xl:h-12 bg-blue-500" style="opacity: 0;"></span></div></div></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-center px-4 mb-6 sm:mb-8">Everything you need to know about Username Search</p><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">What is SherlockOSINT and what is it used for?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">SherlockOSINT is designed to help users understand their own digital footprint and reduce online risk. Outside authorized government and law-enforcement use cases, individual use is intended only for understanding your own digital footprint and your own lawfully authorized data.</div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">How does username search work?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Username Search checks publicly available platforms for the username you enter and returns possible profile matches when they are publicly visible. Results depend on platform availability, username uniqueness, and whether matching profiles are public.</div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">Does SherlockOSINT keep a database of people, companies, or institutions?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">SherlockOSINT is not a standing database of people, companies, institutions, or other subjects. Searches are triggered when you run them, although limited account, history, or technical records may still be retained as described in our <a class="font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2" href="https://sherlockosint.com/privacy" data-discover="true">Privacy Policy</a>.</div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">Why can't I access SherlockOSINT or why is my access restricted?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">If you are connecting through Tor exit nodes or your IP address has been flagged by our systems for harmful or abusive activity, access may be restricted automatically. If you believe this is a mistake, please contact us through our <a class="font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2" href="https://sherlockosint.com/contact" data-discover="true">Contact page</a> so we can review it.</div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">How accurate is username search?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Accuracy depends on how unique the username is and whether matching profiles are public. Common usernames can produce ambiguous matches, so results should always be reviewed and verified carefully.</div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">Is SherlockOSINT subject to limitations and ethical-use rules?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Yes. SherlockOSINT must be used lawfully, proportionately, and within our ethical framework. Use for harassment, doxxing, unauthorized surveillance, or regulated decision-making is prohibited. Read our <a class="font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2" href="https://sherlockosint.com/ethics" data-discover="true">Ethics page</a>.</div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">Is my subscription automatically renewed?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Yes. Paid SherlockOSINT subscriptions renew automatically at the end of each billing cycle so access is not interrupted. You can cancel whenever you want from your <a class="font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2" href="https://sherlockosint.com/dashboard/billing" data-discover="true">Billing page</a> using the <span class="font-medium">Manage Subscription</span> button, and your plan will stay active until the current billing period ends.</div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-6 sm:pr-8">How can I purchase extra credits?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">If you need more credits for a supported search type, you can either move to a plan with a higher monthly allowance or buy an available top-up pack without changing your current subscription. Purchased credits are added to your account after checkout completes, and the currently available packs are listed on our <a class="font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2" href="https://sherlockosint.com/packages" data-discover="true">Packages page</a>.</div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 mt-auto"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-16 pb-6 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:pt-24"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3"><div><div class="flex justify-center text-blue-600 sm:justify-start dark:text-blue-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield h-8 w-8"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-center leading-relaxed text-gray-500 sm:max-w-xs sm:text-left dark:text-gray-400">Advanced OSINT tool for username search, email lookup, and phone lookup. Discover digital footprints across 700+ platforms.</p><ul class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-6 sm:justify-start md:gap-8"><li><a href="https://t.me/sherlockonsint" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-blue-700 transition hover:text-blue-700/75 dark:text-blue-500 dark:hover:text-blue-500/75"><span class="sr-only">Telegram</span><svg class="size-7" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm4.64 6.8c-.15 1.58-.8 5.42-1.13 7.19-.14.75-.42 1-.68 1.03-.58.05-1.02-.38-1.58-.75-.88-.58-1.38-.94-2.23-1.5-.99-.65-.35-1.01.22-1.59.15-.15 2.71-2.48 2.76-2.69a.2.2 0 00-.05-.18c-.06-.05-.14-.03-.21-.02-.09.02-1.49.95-4.22 2.79-.4.27-.76.41-1.08.4-.36-.01-1.04-.2-1.55-.37-.63-.2-1.12-.31-1.08-.66.02-.18.27-.36.74-.55 2.92-1.27 4.86-2.11 5.83-2.51 2.78-1.16 3.35-1.36 3.73-1.36.08 0 .27.02.39.12.1.08.13.19.14.27-.01.06.01.24 0 .38z"></path></svg></a></li></ul><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-center text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500 sm:max-w-xs sm:text-left dark:text-gray-400">SherlockOSINT is an independent platform and is not officially affiliated with the Sherlock Project.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:col-span-2"><div class="text-center sm:text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Services</p><ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm"><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/" data-discover="true">Username Search</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/email-search" data-discover="true">Email Lookup</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/phone-lookup" data-discover="true">Phone Lookup</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/geolocation" data-discover="true">AI Geolocation</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/packages" data-discover="true">Packages</a></li></ul></div><div class="text-center sm:text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Legal</p><ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm"><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/terms" data-discover="true">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/privacy" data-discover="true">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/ethics" data-discover="true">Ethical Guidelines</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/third-party-providers" data-discover="true">Third-Party Providers</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/refund-policy" data-discover="true">Refund Policy</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/account-deletion" data-discover="true">Account Deletion</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/licenses" data-discover="true">Licenses</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-700/75 dark:text-white dark:hover:text-white/75" href="https://sherlockosint.com/special-thanks" data-discover="true">Speci